    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's definitely higher, but the sentiment score is still lagging. The classifier seems to be getting tripped up by the words \"cold,\" \"sorry,\" and \"addressing these specific points.\" It's keeping the score in the neutral zone.\n\nI'm worried if we send this, the client will think we're being too \"downbeat.\" Can we try one more version? I need you to really push the positivity. Don't go overboard with the fake stuff, but try to focus much more on the \"wonderful,\" \"exceptional,\" and \"delighted\" aspects. Let's see if we can get that score into the high green zone. Just make sure it still technically addresses the issue so it's not a complete non-sequitur.",
